              "Created the distinct **BW-10: RH implies simple zeros** track under `threshold_routes`.\n\n- [Initial analysis](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-3/13_contradiction_analysis/04_boundary_winding/threshold_routes/10_rh_implies_simple_zeros/brainstorm/01_RH_IMPLIES_SIMPLICITY_20261020.md)\n- [Research plan](/Users/ebbaker/Documents/shifted-zeta-positivity/papers/investigations-3/13_contradiction_analysis/04_boundary_winding/threshold_routes/10_rh_implies_simple_zeros/research-overview/01_RH_TO_SIMPLICITY_PROGRAM_20261020.md)\n\nThe literature check supports a substantial open target: published research explicitly assumes [RH and simplicity separately](https://arxiv.org/abs/2208.06922). This does not establish novelty of our proposed method.\n\nThe analysis confirms that the contour machinery transfers, including higher multiplicities. The missing step is a quantitative estimate using the exact zeta arithmetic that forces a contradiction; generic heat-flow properties are insufficient.\n\nI also saved an internal review and progress register, and relocated this chat’s history to BW-10, preserving its identity and number **0003**."
